  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_001 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200 + resnet50, avgpool + weighted) achieves 0.677 validation accuracy. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a stronger image encoder) while keeping other components identical. It isolates the impact of the image encoder choice, a critical design decision, and could reveal whether ViT improves performance. This addresses uncertainty about encoder effectiveness while building on the existing multimodal/multiprofile foundation."  
